{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"You guys are good DMs, and I can tell you really love what you do. I just don't think *I* mesh with you guys, and I'm sorry about that. I think I will leave, maybe come back next year. I really loved this place, at least back in London where life was simpler. Man, you guys've mastered *forcing me into character* (In a good way, coming from someone who acts onstage). I just don't think I'm the right fit, I don't think my mental health is in the best place, and I don't want that to negatively impact me *or* the other members of the server. I'd really like to play with some of you again someday, but for now I just want to return to pseudo-happy times. \n\nIf you wanna hear me whine: ||Also it may be related to the facts I've had persistent depression and PTSD for years, that I'm coming out as trans and bi in a small town where I've been beaten with sticks, today is the anniversary of my really close family member's death, that the world is in shambles, and other factors.||","created_at":"2020-08-04T05:05:35.736000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740072927206047775","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
